					"Movement": {"Type": "Forward","Direction": [0, -1],"Speed": 0.000001,"CutOffDistance": 0.00000003},
					
					"Text": "So... you're supposed to\nclick it, and whenever you\ndo it will create a smaller\nclone of itself."
