					"Movement": {"Type": "Forward","Direction": [0, -1],"Speed": 0.000001,"CutOffDistance": 0.00000003},
					
					"Text": "Also there won't be any supply\ndrops for this experiment.\nDr. Monkey said to leave\nthose out, sorry."
